NativeSupporterVault::activateSettlement / recoveryCaps
├── Given unauthorized/repeated/premature call, reused/empty manifest, no-basis budget or excess budget
│   └── It rejects without changing rates
├── Given healthy available canonical valuation
│   └── Principal cap is min(exportedQ+repairQ,floorInverse(B0)), never returnedQ counted twice
├── Given impaired/zero available valuation
│   └── Principal cap is all attributed backing, without an invalid inverse
├── Given any bucket not fully authenticated/funded
│   └── It cannot open first-come settlement
└── Given fixed fully funded separate budgets, including zeros
    └── It activates once with immutable denominators and separate initial/final commitments
